<PublicLayout title="Licences and provenance" description="Inspect the source licence before redistributing a resource."><section class="mb-8 max-w-3xl"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Resource licences</h2><p class="leading-relaxed">Each resource page and registry JSON declares its SPDX licence, creator, origin and attribution requirements. Those per-resource terms govern redistribution. Inspect the Code and Dependencies tabs alongside the licence.</p></section><section class="mb-8 max-w-3xl"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Repository licence</h2><p class="leading-relaxed">The repository licence is available in the source tree. This page does not replace third-party notices or grant rights beyond the published licences.</p></section><section class="mb-8 max-w-3xl"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Exports</h2><p class="leading-relaxed">Standalone projects include the licences of the selected resources. Keep attribution and dependency notices when distributing your project.</p></section><p class="flex flex-wrap gap-5"><a class="underline" href="https://github.com/danishgm-sketch/Tessellate">Repository and contributions</a><a class="underline" href="/docs">Documentation</a><a class="underline" href="/explore">Inspect resource licences</a></p></PublicLayout>
